      "content": "i get the loyalty thing, but you're talking about this from a pretty idealistic standpoint. if my competitors are using ai to slash their headcount and drastically lower their prices, they're going to squeeze me out of the market. staying \"loyal\" to staff might just mean my company goes bankrupt. shouldn't the primary responsibility of a business be its own survival and staying competitive in a changing economy?",
